=== String replace
--- input
\Text(hello world)::replace(old=hello, new=goodbye)
\Text(Eyjafjallajökull)::replace(old=ja, ll, new=a,l)
\Text(Lorem ipsum orem)::replace(old=Lorem, orem, new=First, Second)
\Text(Spanish Inquisition)::replace(old=i, it, new=ati, atati)
--- output
goodbye world
Eyafalajökul
First ipsum Second
Spanatish Inquatisatitation
